# Misnamed scraped artifact: this is a libcurl/Netscape cookie file holding
# session cookies, not a jar. Removed from tracking on 2026-09-15; it is still
# present in git history and needs a separate history purge if that matters.
p41-ml3.jar

# Agent git-worktrees belong under sp-wt/. They must be created inside the
# repo (git worktree add sp-wt/<branch> <branch>) — never at the repo root
# itself and never as a sibling of the repo outside the tree, because
# .gitignore only applies inside the repo: an external worktree cannot be
# ignored and shows up as an untracked directory in every `git status`.
/sp-wt/

# NOTE: .agents is intentionally NOT ignored — the context knowledge base
# at .agents/context/ must be committed with the repo (see AGENTS.md).
 